 says open 24/7. Check for temporary closures before departure.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"raising-canes-walnut","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Raising Cane’s — Walnut Street","title":"The After-Midnight Chicken Run","subtitle":"Late counter service at 3925 Walnut Street","notes":"This is a later food option west of campus, with dine-in availability extending past midnight on part of the weekly schedule.","short_summary":"A chicken-finger restaurant with dine-in and later general operating hours.","evidence_claim":"Raising Cane’s official page lists general hours until 2 a.m. Sunday–Wednesday and 3 a.m. Thursday–Saturday; dine-in closes at midnight Sunday–Wednesday and 1 a.m. Thursday–Saturday.","source_url":"https://locations.raisingcanes.com/pa/philadelphia/3925-walnut-street","source_title":"Raising Cane’s in Philadelphia, PA — 3925 Walnut Street","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Dine-in closes earlier than the location’s general operating hours. Verify the desired ordering method and current schedule.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"shake-shack-university-city","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Shake Shack University City","title":"The Midnight Chestnut-Street Meal","subtitle":"A campus-edge restaurant at 3200 Chestnut Street","notes":"Its location between 32nd and 33rd streets makes it one of the closest externally operated late-meal options to Drexel’s academic core.","short_summary":"A counter-service restaurant offering burgers, chicken, hot dogs, frozen custard, and other menu items.","evidence_claim":"Shake Shack’s official University City page lists closing at midnight Thursday–Saturday and 11 p.m. Sunday–Wednesday.","source_url":"https://shakeshack.com/location/university-city-pa","source_title":"Shake Shack at 3200 Chestnut Street Philad